{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/efa267297d0526c13819df3bd3ac9bf9.avif?t=1764437061\" width=946 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/de90dc9cb6407141fbdc4befbab9a90f.avif?t=1764437061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras_big/de90dc9cb6407141fbdc4befbab9a90f.avif?t=1764437061 width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Symphone</i> is a platformer set in a once-vibrant world now consumed by a mysterious force known as &quot;The Silence.&quot; This dark power steals the voices of the creatures of Symphone, turning them into lost souls wandering aimlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/4fdecb03a3dc9359a2143d65bbe92e9e.avif?t=1764437061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras_big/4fdecb03a3dc9359a2143d65bbe92e9e.avif?t=1764437061 width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Euphony, a unique bunny without a voice, on a quest to collect these souls and restore the music and light that once filled the forest. Journey through a desolate, bioluminescent world, overcoming obstacles, and dodging threats to free the souls trapped by &quot;The Silence.&quot; Each soul you collect brings Euphony closer to completing the final symphony, a powerful melody capable of banishing the darkness once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/72d87be09184a7391513f3b7a273f900.avif?t=1764437061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras_big/72d87be09184a7391513f3b7a273f900.avif?t=1764437061 width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming Action</strong> \u2013 Jump, dodge, and explore a beautiful yet haunting forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Story</strong> \u2013 Experience a touching narrative about loss, restoration, and hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Music</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a captivating soundtrack that follows you throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bioluminescent World</strong> \u2013 Stunning visual style with glowing environments that come to life as you restore balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Obstacles</strong> \u2013 Face environmental challenges and enemies in your journey to save the world from The Silence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Euphony restore harmony to Symphone and bring light back to her world. Will you be the one to end The Silence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3379210?t=1764437061","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3379210?t=1764437061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/4a5c4b20a6b607be2c1a1f4a42e0cfd560ea876d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764437061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/4a5c4b20a6b607be2c1a1f4a42e0cfd560ea876d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764437061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/efa267297d0526c13819df3bd3ac9bf9.avif?t=1764437061\" width=946 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/de90dc9cb6407141fbdc4befbab9a90f.avif?t=1764437061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras_big/de90dc9cb6407141fbdc4befbab9a90f.avif?t=1764437061 width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Symphone</i> is a platformer set in a once-vibrant world now consumed by a mysterious force known as &quot;The Silence.&quot; This dark power steals the voices of the creatures of Symphone, turning them into lost souls wandering aimlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/4fdecb03a3dc9359a2143d65bbe92e9e.avif?t=1764437061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras_big/4fdecb03a3dc9359a2143d65bbe92e9e.avif?t=1764437061 width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Euphony, a unique bunny without a voice, on a quest to collect these souls and restore the music and light that once filled the forest. Journey through a desolate, bioluminescent world, overcoming obstacles, and dodging threats to free the souls trapped by &quot;The Silence.&quot; Each soul you collect brings Euphony closer to completing the final symphony, a powerful melody capable of banishing the darkness once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/72d87be09184a7391513f3b7a273f900.avif?t=1764437061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras_big/72d87be09184a7391513f3b7a273f900.avif?t=1764437061 width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming Action</strong> \u2013 Jump, dodge, and explore a beautiful yet haunting forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Story</strong> \u2013 Experience a touching narrative about loss, restoration, and hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Music</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a captivating soundtrack that follows you throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bioluminescent World</strong> \u2013 Stunning visual style with glowing environments that come to life as you restore balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Obstacles</strong> \u2013 Face environmental challenges and enemies in your journey to save the world from The Silence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Euphony restore harmony to Symphone and bring light back to her world. Will you be the one to end The Silence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Incine"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/header.jpg?t=1764437061","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.